# Everything in this repository is encrypted with git-crypt (AES-256).
# Only the workflow files, this file and the short public notes stay readable,
# because GitHub needs them to run the automation. The key lives in GitHub's
# encrypted Actions secrets and in Dai's private vault, nowhere else.
* filter=git-crypt diff=git-crypt
.gitattributes !filter !diff
.gitignore !filter !diff
.github/** !filter !diff
README.md !filter !diff
SECURITY.md !filter !diff
LICENSE !filter !diff
.gitleaks.toml !filter !diff
.gitleaksignore !filter !diff
**/.gitkeep !filter !diff
